WEBVTT

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.360
Why are you here?!

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.300
The spell to keep me asleep wore off.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.710
That's not what I mean!
I know the spell wore off!

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:19.000
How could you just waltz up to 
me after what I did to you?!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.840
Oh, that's what you meant?

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.840
I didn't think what you did 
was <i>that</i> horrible, really.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.450
Do you... even have any 
idea what I did to you?

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.210
I had every intention of killing you!

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.720
That's definitely not true.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.430
I mean, if you really wanted to kill me,

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.410
it would've been way easier to just

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.580
kill me on the spot than use dark 
magic to make me sleep.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:52.780
I came here because I wanted another 
chance to really talk to you.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:53.900
Talk?

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:55.720
Yes.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.400
When I looked at you then,

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.520
you were crying... and you looked like 
you were in terrible pain.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:05.040
So I wanted to try once more to 
get you to talk to me.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.080
Stay away!

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.220
Oh, no!

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:10.370
Miss Maria!

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:13.210
The black fog is growing bigger!

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.390
What?!

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.300
Sirius, why would you do this?

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.550
Where did you get your dark magic?

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.880
Answer me, Sirius Dieke!

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.000
Sirius?

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.810
He doesn't exist anymore.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:33.360
Sirius died a long time ago!

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.520
What are you saying?

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.110
Eight years ago,

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.990
someone I treasured deeply was 
taken from me here.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.250
They ruined my happiness!

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:48.170
<b>Episode 12
The Final Event Has Begun...</b>

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:54.040
The tea you make has such a gentle flavor.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:58.960
I practiced just so I 
could make you happy, Mom.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.910
Thank you.

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:05.040
I'm blessed to have such a wonderful son.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:17.650
The child has awakened.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.870
Now we can begin.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:25.200
My beloved little one...

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.070
Soon, you will have a new body.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.750
Now, bring the sacrifice.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.090
Mom!

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:38.940
Stop it!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:42.190
Do not handle him roughly.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:45.450
He is going to become my precious Sirius.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.210
Marchioness Dieke, if you despise me,

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.390
I don't care what you do to me!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.050
Just spare my son, please!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.950
What impudence!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:59.360
You took my husband from me and 
were blessed with a child,

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.070
and you still demand more?!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:06.910
I only kept the marquis company that one 
time because he ordered me to on a whim!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.900
I have no intention of 
going anywhere near him again.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:14.540
I only want to live a quiet life with my child!

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.750
I will not...

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.360
I will not allow only the two 
of you to live a happy life!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.010
Now, it's time to begin.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.300
Begin what?

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:29.360
My son is afflicted with an incurable disease.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:33.140
The poor thing doesn't have much time left.

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:37.600
But with dark magic, I can control one's mind

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.900
and transfer memories from one to another.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:44.160
All my son needs is a healthy body, 
and he can live.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.760
Fulfill this need for my son!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.640
If you'll do that, I'll forgive you!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.790
Oub grisa...

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.120
Ioralle...

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.240
Yiavonn...

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:58.500
Ioralle... Eltenfor... Federid...

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.240
Yidegrahde...

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:03.000
Itendor... Wilgwolle.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.430
Mom!

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:26.120
Please... avenge me.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.330
Mom!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.900
Well? Did it work?

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.780
Yes, my lady.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:38.130
We have succeeded in acquiring 
dark magic, as the texts stated.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.080
Good. Now...

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:44.100
Transfer Sirius's memories into 
this boy's body.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.210
You are all I have.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.060
I can depend on no one else.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.020
So I won't let you die, my Sirius!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.980
It is done.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.100
Mo...ther...

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.220
Sirius! It's you!

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:18.400
The dark magic was successful!

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.430
My lady, my work here is done.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:26.810
May I return to my family 
now, as you promised?

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:30.170
Yes, of course. I'll return you 
to them immediately.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.810
Why... did you deceive me?!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.690
To let you live would be too great a risk.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.320
Curse you!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.740
I won't let you get away with this!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.050
I swear I'll see you rot in hell!

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:49.950
Finish him.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.130
Sirius's memories told me

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:07.500
that my playboy father, the marquis, 
had an affair with my mother, who was a maid.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.540
That woman loathed my mother for it,

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:12.890
so she sacrificed her in 
order to acquire dark magic.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:15.240
If all had gone according to 
that woman's plan,

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.640
I would no longer be myself, 
but only the vessel

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.150
that would become Sirius Dieke.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.660
But her plan failed.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:25.480
That woman just wanted to 
continue clinging to Sirius

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.120
so that she could feel better.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:31.120
The memories transferred to 
me were only information.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.840
They weren't Sirius's actual 
thoughts or feelings.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.870
Also, for some reason, <i>I</i> acquired dark magic.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.080
I figured I could use it to get my revenge.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:45.560
I've been playing the good boy all 
this time, pretending to be Sirius...

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:49.210
so that I can inherit the Dieke family name

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.590
and destroy everything that woman holds dear!

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:53.710
That's what happened?

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.730
And that's why you're in such pain...

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.350
You hypocrite!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:01.010
Do you think you can save me 
like you did all those others,

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:03.340
Good Saint Catarina Claes?!

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.020
If this goes any further, we're all in danger!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.400
Catarina!

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.370
Sister!

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.120
I'll be fine.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.470
I know I can't save you.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:22.150
I'm not the heroine here, after all.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.630
I'm just the villainess, 
here to play the heroine's rival.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.470
Of course I can't save anyone.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:33.200
I can't save you from your suffering.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.150
but I <i>can</i> stay by your side.

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:38.990
Just like they all did for me,

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:43.640
I can stay by your side, hear you 
out when you're sad or hurt,

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.810
and not leave you until you're feeling better.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.840
What's wrong?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:02.600
Sitting out here crying won't 
make it stop hurting.

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:04.990
I'll stay here with you.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.580
I won't leave you until you're feeling better.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.020
So don't cry all alone,

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.830
Raphael.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.880
How do you know my...

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.460
Raphael...

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.330
Please... live.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:31.150
Live... and be happy.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.870
I love you.

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:53.850
What are you doing?

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.710
Don't listen to what this woman says!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:58.720
If you take them all hostage, 
you can still get out of this!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:08:59.730
No!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.650
I'm done trying to get revenge!

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:02.640
What?!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.560
I remember everything now!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.520
My mom's last words...

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.090
She wasn't telling me to avenge her!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.570
Just who are you?!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.080
So you've figured it out.

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.800
You're the man who killed my mother!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.490
You found your way inside my mind,

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:22.560
and you've been controlling me all this time!

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:27.000
I was only helping you fulfill your own wish.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.610
It's true that I hate them...

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.220
And I hate that woman.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:35.290
But I didn't survive just so 
I could get revenge!

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:39.170
I survived so I could find happiness!

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.750
I won't allow you to be happy!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.130
Traitor!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.960
It's okay.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.360
I'm done living for revenge!

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.890
I don't need you!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:20.320
The black fog is dissipating...

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.480
<i>Sirius Dieke...</i>

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.260
<i>His real name is Raphael Walt.</i>

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.960
<i>He said that he would tell the 
authorities everything</i>

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.800
<i>and left the school.</i>

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.990
I want to make my mother's wish come true.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:49.780
I'm going to atone for my sins and start over.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:51.970
President...

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:59.420
<i>His testimony exposed the crimes of 
Marchioness Dieke and her underlings.</i>

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.170
<i>I miss having the student council 
president around,</i>

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:08.410
<i>but I've avoided the bad ending in 
which everyone gets killed.</i>

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:11.930
<i>Still... I can't let my guard down just yet!</i>

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.450
<i>The game's final event,</i>

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.540
<i>the second-years' graduation party,</i>

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.140
<i>is still to come!</i>

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.280
There, it's all done.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.460
I let out the midsection a bit,

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.880
but you should be careful not to overeat.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:30.710
I know! Thanks, Anne!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.790
<i>The time has finally come.</i>

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.420
<i>Whether I meet my doom or not</i>

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:39.170
<i>depends on today's graduation party!</i>

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:45.390
Our 19,800th strategy meeting 
will now commence.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:48.940
The day of the second-years' 
graduation party is finally here!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:53.600
The game's heroine, Maria, leaves 
in the middle of the party

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:57.110
to confess her love to 
the object of her affections!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:12:01.320
Maria

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.320
<i>Please allow me to stay by 
your side from now on.</i>

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.320
Please allow me to stay by your side from now on.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.930
Whether Maria has a 
happy ending or a bad ending

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:07.760
will determine the course of 
Catarina's future!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.990
To be exiled, or to be killed by 
the conquerable characters...

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.840
We've made all the preparations we 
could to avoid both.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.880
Yes.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:19.010
She's been preparing for 
this ever since she was little.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.370
Let's go over things one last time!

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:22.540
Right!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.270
The toy snake she carries to 
scare Geordo is in her pocket!

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:30.520
All the things she'll need to 
survive in exile are packed.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.510
So everything is ready.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.560
All we can do now is hope for the best!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:39.900
This meeting is now adjourned!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:42.480
It's the culmination of the past eight years.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.890
Bring it on if you must, doom flag!

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.840
I, Catarina, will take you on!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.480
Take care, Lady Catarina.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:59.870
Congratulations on your graduation, 
Master Nicol!

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.850
Thank you.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.090
Brother.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.680
Congratulations on your graduation.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.910
Master Nicol, this is for you.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.640
Oh, thank you.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.310
I have a present for you, too!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.500
Here you go. I hope you like it.

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.180
Lady Catarina, what is that?

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.620
What's going on?

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.840
What's up with this grass?

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:32.440
How rude! That's not just grass!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.750
I call it a veggie bouquet!

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.640
A veggie... bouquet?

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:41.210
I figured it would be boring to 
get nothing but flowers,

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.000
so I made a bouquet out 
of vegetables from my farm!

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:46.700
Instead of just a decoration to 
throw away later,

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.310
I thought you'd like something that 
would fill your belly!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.850
Thank you. I'll eat it with gratitude.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.840
<i>Maria hasn't made her move yet.</i>

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.800
<i>The two of them have already started 
performing together...</i>

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:38.830
<i>No sign of Keith or Nicol leaving 
with Maria, either.</i>

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.770
<i>I don't think the game even had a scene</i>

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.810
<i>where Geordo and Alan performed together...</i>

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:45.520
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:50.140
<i>Did this somehow turn into the 
reverse harem route,</i>

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:53.040
<i>where Maria ends up with all of them?!</i>

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.120
<i>I never cleared the reverse harem route,</i>

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.370
<i>but Acchan told me that Catarina is 
doomed at the end of it, too!</i>

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.850
<i>What are you going to do, Maria?!</i>

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.240
<i>Are you going for a reverse harem,</i>

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:05.330
<i>or are you going to end up with one of them?!</i>

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.160
<i>The party will be over soon!</i>

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:26.060
<i>Why aren't you doing anything, Maria?!</i>

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.530
Sister, I think you're eating too much.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.910
Huh? Am I?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.140
I've been a little worried about something.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.960
I didn't even realize I was eating so much.

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:41.080
I think your stomach is what you 
should be worried about.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:45.080
Lady Catarina, please have my 
cake, as well, if you'd like.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.080
And mine!

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.920
Thanks.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.340
I'm just going to go get a drink.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:55.640
<i>My fate depends on the direction 
Maria's love life takes!</i>

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.350
<i>I can't wait around any longer!</i>

00:15:58.530 --> 00:15:59.880
Hey, Maria!

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.520
Is there someone you like?

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:16.110
I'm very fond of you, Lady Catarina.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.220
Um, Maria...

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.310
I'm happy to hear that...

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.620
but that's not what I mean.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:26.130
Is there a boy that you like and 
want to have a relationship with?

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:31.100
A boy I like and want a relationship with...

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.790
<i>Come on, tell me straight-up!</i>

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.060
<i>Maria, who are you going to end up with?!</i>

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.290
No, there isn't.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:40.100
Huh?

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.960
There aren't any boys I'm interested in.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:48.830
The only one I love, admire, 
and want to be with for all time

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:50.600
is you, Lady Catarina.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:55.910
So please allow me to stay by 
your side from now on.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:17:00.660
<i>Th-That's the line she says to the 
guy she conquers in the game!</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.250
<i>Why is she saying it to me?!</i>

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.710
I won't allow you to get 
ahead of me, Miss Maria.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.680
I'm staying with Lady Catarina forever, too!

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:08.960
Me, too!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:12.580
Lady Catarina, please allow me 
to be with you forever and ever!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.720
Then I'd like to be with you, too, 
for as long as I may.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.460
Th-Then so would I!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.730
What are you all talking about?

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:22.190
Catarina is engaged to me.

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:24.990
Prince Geordo, as I've told you many times,

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:27.480
my sister isn't fit to 
serve as a prince's consort.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:30.840
Keith, as I've told you many, many times,

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:33.290
I will absolutely never break 
off our engagement.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.000
Perhaps it's time for you 
to outgrow your big sister.

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:38.820
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.280
<i>It is! It's the friendship ending!</i>

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:43.860
<i>The heroine doesn't end up with anyone,</i>

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:46.010
<i>but the story ends with everyone 
being good friends.</i>

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.470
<i>It might be considered a bad 
ending by romance game standards,</i>

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:52.260
<i>but this means I'm not doomed!</i>

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:59.590
<i>I did it! I avoided my doom ending!</i>

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.690
Thank you all so much for coming today.

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:10.430
Brother, please come visit us 
at school whenever you like.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:13.670
You'll fall behind the others if you don't.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.640
Everyone, we have dessert, too.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.500
Please help yourselves.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.150
Wow! It looks even tastier than usual today!

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:23.240
Did you make it?

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:27.040
Yes, my mother and I 
came up with a new recipe.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.240
Your mother?

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:34.330
She thought you might get tired of 
eating the same sweets all the time,

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:37.390
so she helped me come up with a new recipe.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:39.340
I see!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:42.040
Be sure to thank her for me, too.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:42.980
I will.

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:45.780
We have tea, as well, Lady Catarina.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:47.400
Thanks, Mary!

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.020
Let's eat!

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:54.160
This is...

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.070
President!

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.850
I'm not the student council president anymore,

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.870
but thank you for inviting me.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:09.760
We invited him because we knew it'd 
make you happy, Lady Catarina.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:12.780
And we kept quiet so it would be a surprise.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.700
I had no idea!

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.920
I'm so happy to see you, President!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.720
Uh, I mean... Master Raphael!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.380
Are you coming back to school?

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:25.940
No, I'm sad that I wasn't able to graduate,

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:29.840
but I'm going to be working for 
the Department of Magic now...

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.480
as Raphael Walt.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:32.870
I see!

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:35.980
I guess that means we'll be 
able to see you again.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:39.340
I guess so, since it's here on campus.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:48.050
In spite of everything that happened, 
would you allow me

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:51.340
to stay by your side, Lady Catarina Claes?

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.930
Of course!

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:55.250
And you don't have to use that title with me.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.010
Just call me what you've always called me.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.520
Right in front of her fiancé...

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:09.390
You've seduced yet another one, Sister.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.760
Seriously, that girl...

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:14.270
Now I have yet another rival.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.820
That's our Lady Catarina.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.660
Come, everyone, let's eat.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.010
Spring is here.

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:38.170
Yes, it certainly is, darling.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:12.000
<i>When I was reincarnated as a villainess in an 
otome game where all routes led to my doom,</i>

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.690
<i>I spent my days complaining about how 
my luck couldn't be any worse.</i>

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.160
<i>But now,</i>

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:28.290
<i>I can say loudly and proudly...</i>

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:31.110
<i>that I, Catarina Claes, am truly blessed</i>

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:35.560
<i>to have met all these wonderful people.</i>

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:47.600
<i>I have no idea what's 
going to happen from now on.</i>

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:58.310
<i>A new season that wasn't in the game's 
script is about to begin!</i>

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.750
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.760
By the way, as for that one thing 
I never got a chance to use...

00:23:33.860 --> 00:23:36.400
It looks real!

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:36.400
Wow, it's so cool!

00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:36.400
Dad, I want that!

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:39.390
It's now available to purchase, 
and it's a big hit in town!
